{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":379180,"duration_api_ms":183438,"ttft_ms":2504,"ttft_stream_ms":1924,"time_to_request_ms":203,"num_turns":25,"result":"Done. One program completed this sample.\n\n## Summary\n\n**prog004** — combined both parents: prog003's evidence-first restyle (the phrasing lever) + a new **per-slot alignment guard** (the F1 protection prog003 lacked).\n\n**Hypothesis** (grounded in the prog003 log): prog003's bolder evidence-first restyle lifted phrasing/pairwise but scrambled multi-task lists — collapsing distinct tasks into one compound string and duplicating it across slots — because the token-subset guard only blocks hallucinated *words*, not cross-slot content leakage (every word in a compounded slot is still input-present). The prog003 log prescribed exactly the fix: a per-slot alignment guard.\n\n**Implementation:** kept prog003's grounded restyle prompt/schema unchanged, added `slotAligned()`: a styled slot is accepted only if it (a) still carries ≥ half of its own base task's content stems (anchor), and (b) introduces no content stem unique to a *different* base task (blocks cross-slot merge/dup). Rejected slots fall back to their own finished base — so set membership stays identical to the reasoned base, F1 protected by construction.\n\n**Result — NEW BEST, fitness 0.735** (elite prog002 was 0.710):\n- F1 **0.882** — scramble fixed (prog003 had regressed to 0.842; prog002 was 0.877)\n- phrasing **4**, pairwise **12T/10L** (prog002 was 8T/13L)\n- prog003's completeness wins survived (multi_moving phrasing 5 with \"with the post office\"/\"to the landlord\"/\"this weekend\" restored)\n\nIt strictly dominates both parents. Honest caveat logged: the +0.025 margin over elite sits within the ~0.04 noise band, though every signal moved coherently. The residual is now an **extraction** gap (terse base fragments on simple lists; missed buried tasks like the insurance call), not a restyle gap — the next lever.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a75a2462-b68e-44e2-b253-ac1f6f1ddedc","total_cost_usd":0.9318017500000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":48,"cache_creation_input_tokens":46183,"cache_read_input_tokens":610184,"output_tokens":13489,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":46183},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":664,"cache_read_input_tokens":46159,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1408,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1408,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":521,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.000601,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-8":{"inputTokens":48,"outputTokens":13489,"cacheReadInputTokens":610184,"cacheCreationInputTokens":46183,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.93120075,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"73e11650-82b4-4f2d-a9f6-569b4713f3d9"}
